  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency food assistance, cash and social protection system strengthening in Ukraine and Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the World Food Programme (WFP) in Ukraine and Moldova, to deliver cash and in kind food support, as well as supporting the harmonisation of the Ukrainian social protection databases and provide technical assistance to the Government of Moldova to enhance shock-responsive social protection and food security systems and capacities.</narrative>
  </description>
